## 3. Funding Submission Bot

### Problem

Post-delivery funding package submission was a repetitive multi-system sequence — pull
documents, upload to the lender portal, submit the package, update status — at roughly 4
minutes per transaction, 30+ hours weekly.

### Solution

Event-driven automation triggered by Salesforce delivery status changes:

- Pulled funding documentation automatically on status transition
- Uploaded documents to DealerTrack
- Submitted completed lender funding packages
- Wrote workflow status back to Salesforce

Built on the same authenticated-session core as the CSN bot — the expensive, fragile part
(SSO, MFA, session persistence) was already solved and reusable.

### Impact

- ~ 4 minutes → ~90 seconds per transaction
- 30+ weekly hours → under 3
- Near-zero operational error rate

### Stack

Python · Playwright · Salesforce API · DealerTrack · Okta SSO · Claude

